Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21
Quest 98 "Glyptodont hunt"
    Journal "[Sentinel] Patrick asked me to hunt 1 Glyptodont."
    Kill 1 of 450 at direction_595

Requires player level >= 20

Rewards
    Give 50000 experience
    Give 30 of 900790000
    Give 30 of 900820000

direction_4 = location "[Guard] Patrick" about "[Guard] Patrick\nSentinel with high self-esteem who guards Moradon; always strives for Moradon`s safety" found "Moradon central stepfront" at 830 551 in zone 21
direction_595 = location "Glyptodon" about "Glyptodon\nDocile large-bodied monster which can grow savagely violent. " found "Moradon" at 586 573 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, Do you know a monster called the Glyptodont? Let's go and ask [Sentinel Patrick] about it."
    Topic "Where is the [Sentinel]?" do
        Map direction_4

On offer
    Say "The Glyptodont? You're talking about that big, ugly-looking bugger?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Well, the Glyptodont is a giant omnivore that can be found pretty much anywhere on the Adonisian Continent. It's slow, but hits hard. How about going out and thinning their numbers a bit? It'll go much easier if you form a party."

On in_progress
    Say "It'll be hard to deal with on your own. Better to form a party before tackling it."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_595

On ready
    Say "Phew! Well done master. It looks stupid, but it's pretty powerful. Hee Hee!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "So, what's it like hunting Glyptodont? Ha Ha! Anyway, Well done."
